WEBVTT

00:03.834 --> 00:05.634
Welcome back, Miss Shoko!

00:07.434 --> 00:10.494
Now now, you have to close the door properly!

00:13.814 --> 00:15.304
That's your sister.

00:27.124 --> 00:31.054
P-pleased to meet you. I'm Karada lokawa.

00:31.764 --> 00:32.814
Big Brother!

00:35.894 --> 00:38.994
Something reached for but cannot be grasped...

00:40.604 --> 00:44.134
Something that strays from that hand,
going far away...

00:45.774 --> 00:49.974
People will always pursue such things.

00:51.014 --> 00:54.644
And before long, become lost.

01:00.524 --> 01:04.324
This is our story of one such summer.

01:22.644 --> 01:24.084
Living for the Day
After Tomorrow

01:24.084 --> 01:27.754
Living for the Day
After Tomorrow
Asphalt ni saita

01:27.754 --> 01:28.214
Living for the Day
After Tomorrow

01:28.514 --> 01:32.184
Kodomo no rakugaki ga

01:32.954 --> 01:36.584
Kagerou ni yurarete

01:37.424 --> 01:40.264
Arukidashita

01:40.394 --> 01:45.234
Daremo shiranai yakusoku no

01:45.234 --> 01:48.864
Oka de meguriau

01:49.404 --> 01:54.114
Tatta ichido no kyou to iu

01:54.114 --> 01:58.884
Kiseki no toki wo kanjite

01:58.884 --> 02:03.054
Nagareru kumo oikakete

02:03.054 --> 02:07.394
Imanimo tsukamesou na

02:07.394 --> 02:11.764
Mune no yokan takanari

02:11.764 --> 02:16.394
Ugokihajimeta unmei

02:16.494 --> 02:20.874
Me ga sameru hodo mabushii

02:20.874 --> 02:24.894
Asa no hi yorimo atatakai

02:25.144 --> 02:29.044
Owari no nai kagayaku

02:29.374 --> 02:36.684
Hikari no kisetsu ni dakarete

02:54.204 --> 02:57.574
OKONOMIYAKI
APRICOT
CANDY

02:59.704 --> 03:00.804
Hiro.

03:01.214 --> 03:02.834
Where are we going?

03:03.414 --> 03:04.644
Someplace nice.

03:09.614 --> 03:11.144
Hiro...

03:11.484 --> 03:14.044
We can't see the fireworks from here.

03:17.524 --> 03:18.784
Um...

03:19.464 --> 03:21.224
Look straight ahead.

03:53.224 --> 03:57.754
I Want You to Believe

04:04.404 --> 04:07.274
How many times do I have to
repeat myself before you get it?

04:08.014 --> 04:12.344
I turned into a kid, and
Karada became a grown-up.

04:28.094 --> 04:31.364
I didn't believe it myself at first.

04:31.804 --> 04:34.094
But it's a fact.

04:36.004 --> 04:37.334
Fine, I get it.

04:39.404 --> 04:42.904
You're saying that kid
over there is Karada, right?

04:51.884 --> 04:53.154
Karada!

05:00.594 --> 05:02.254
Looks like she's angry with me.

05:38.004 --> 05:40.104
How could you say something like that?

05:40.104 --> 05:41.204
Like what?

05:41.204 --> 05:44.464
Why did you call her a kid?

05:46.574 --> 05:51.414
You know how much that hurts
Karada's feelings, don't you?!

05:55.584 --> 05:59.684
To be told that by you, the person
she most wants to believe...

06:05.624 --> 06:07.964
You know what you're asking me to believe?

06:08.864 --> 06:12.464
I still don't even believe you're Shoko.

06:13.164 --> 06:14.504
Wait right there!

06:19.774 --> 06:20.674
Ow!

06:22.144 --> 06:22.944
Idiot!

06:25.214 --> 06:26.734
You're a stupid idiot!

06:52.874 --> 06:54.134
Karada?

07:12.364 --> 07:13.924
Karada...

07:15.294 --> 07:19.794
I guess there's no way
he would've believed us, huh?

07:20.934 --> 07:22.374
I'm sorry.

07:23.374 --> 07:29.834
It's because I suddenly brought him by...
that... that this happened.

07:31.614 --> 07:36.554
It's my fault. If only I hadn't made that wish.

07:36.954 --> 07:40.014
If only I hadn't wanted that.

07:42.454 --> 07:44.484
None of this would have...

07:49.594 --> 07:51.124
It's all right.

07:51.904 --> 07:54.694
I'm sure he'll understand soon enough.

07:55.804 --> 07:58.334
Right now, he's just confused.

08:02.614 --> 08:08.484
There are plenty of things that only you know,
or only you can do, right?

08:09.354 --> 08:12.014
I'm sure it's just a matter of time.

08:29.974 --> 08:31.334
Hiro...

09:07.104 --> 09:08.134
Okay!

10:02.934 --> 10:04.294
Thanks for the food.

10:51.544 --> 10:54.844
TRAFFIC RESTRICTED
BEGINNING
4:00 PM TODAY
DUE TO TOWN FESTIVAL

10:55.754 --> 10:57.184
C'mon, hurry!

11:08.794 --> 11:10.954
AMINO

11:15.834 --> 11:19.674
Awww, man! This friggin' stinks!

11:20.544 --> 11:21.974
I'm home!

11:22.344 --> 11:25.344
Toko! My, this is unexpected!

11:25.344 --> 11:26.834
Say, where's Tetsu?

11:27.114 --> 11:28.914
He is in his room.

11:35.494 --> 11:39.184
Please do not unduly disturb
Tetsumasa's studies.

11:39.464 --> 11:40.554
Yes, ma'am.

11:41.894 --> 11:43.594
You can stop now.

11:45.004 --> 11:46.494
You doing all right?

11:48.234 --> 11:50.404
Course I'm friggin' not!

11:50.404 --> 11:53.944
Not only am I grounded,
but as you can see, I gotta study!

11:53.944 --> 11:57.274
Study, huh?

12:01.054 --> 12:03.754
If you're worried about Karada,
there've been no new developments.

12:03.754 --> 12:07.524
What the hell?! What are you even doing here?

12:07.524 --> 12:09.584
I just came to get my yukata.

12:10.594 --> 12:11.894
Your yukata?

12:12.194 --> 12:16.754
I'm going to the summer festival tonight
with some regulars from the coffee shop.

12:18.164 --> 12:19.634
The summer festival, huh?

12:20.404 --> 12:24.864
Hey, if lots of people are
gonna be there, then maybe...

12:28.214 --> 12:30.234
What the hell's so funny?!

12:40.124 --> 12:41.854
Here's the plan...

12:49.164 --> 12:52.164
Is it wise to be attending with CUSTOMERS?

12:52.164 --> 12:55.704
Um, I run a coffee shop.

12:55.704 --> 12:58.434
It is the same as any service industry, correct?

13:00.174 --> 13:05.914
Anyway, Tetsu says not to come to his room
so he can concentrate on studying.

13:05.914 --> 13:07.504
Yes, yes.

13:15.754 --> 13:17.594
MEDICINE

13:17.594 --> 13:18.224
MEDICINE
This is for your headache,
and this will bring down the fever.

13:18.224 --> 13:21.664
This is for your headache,
and this will bring down the fever.

13:21.964 --> 13:23.894
Please take both after meals.

13:25.064 --> 13:27.164
Thank you.

13:28.574 --> 13:29.974
Take care.

13:30.974 --> 13:32.944
Something good happen to you?

13:34.514 --> 13:37.374
It's just, you look like you're doing better.

13:37.374 --> 13:39.274
Well, I guess.

13:44.724 --> 13:45.654
Think fast.

13:50.054 --> 13:52.024
Shoko
Nogami

14:00.734 --> 14:02.794
All right then, I'll be waiting.

14:05.774 --> 14:06.904
Um...

14:09.744 --> 14:11.734
It looks good on you.

14:11.914 --> 14:14.404
Uh, Miss Shoko...

14:16.484 --> 14:18.214
I...

14:19.884 --> 14:22.514
You don't have to try to
force me and Hiro to meet.

14:22.954 --> 14:24.324
Karada.

14:26.024 --> 14:27.464
Sit down for a second.

14:32.704 --> 14:37.724
This yukata... I haven't worn it
even once since I bought it.

14:38.504 --> 14:41.494
What with the move and everything,
I never had a chance.

14:42.374 --> 14:47.504
At this rate, no one would ever
have gotten to wear it.

14:49.384 --> 14:51.644
It's just like you two, isn't it?

14:52.984 --> 14:57.584
Unless somebody says something,
the two of you would never meet.

14:59.764 --> 15:01.024
Yes...

15:14.214 --> 15:17.234
Jeez! There's too many people!

15:26.484 --> 15:27.644
What's wrong?

15:28.754 --> 15:30.124
Miss Shoko...

15:30.994 --> 15:33.894
I... I can't do this.

15:34.564 --> 15:36.094
Forget it.

15:36.094 --> 15:37.754
You have to meet him.

15:57.624 --> 16:01.424
The two of you come to this festival
every year, right?

16:01.654 --> 16:02.644
Yes.

16:02.994 --> 16:03.724
Apricot
Candy

16:03.724 --> 16:05.664
Apricot
Candy
How was it last year?

16:05.664 --> 16:05.694
Apricot
Candy
Um... We saw fireworks.

16:05.694 --> 16:08.134
Um... We saw fireworks.

16:08.134 --> 16:09.094
That's it?

16:09.534 --> 16:11.624
And we ate takoyaki!

16:13.434 --> 16:14.904
Takoyaki, huh?

16:14.904 --> 16:17.094
TAKOYAKI

16:17.804 --> 16:19.634
One takoyaki, please.

16:19.904 --> 16:21.174
Coming up.

16:24.884 --> 16:26.674
You know it already, don't you?

16:27.984 --> 16:31.514
You know that's her. That girl is Karada.

16:40.594 --> 16:41.994
Miss Shoko!

16:44.064 --> 16:45.264
I bought us some!

16:45.834 --> 16:47.694
I'll hold on to this.

16:50.604 --> 16:51.864
Let's go.

16:58.414 --> 17:00.544
Um...

17:14.264 --> 17:15.754
That's hot!

17:22.734 --> 17:23.674
Ow!

17:24.704 --> 17:27.434
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

17:28.274 --> 17:30.334
Watch where you're goin'.

17:30.574 --> 17:32.514
I'm very sorry.

17:32.944 --> 17:36.884
Ah! I'm sorry! Sorry...

17:50.364 --> 17:53.064
You should watch where you're going.
You could get hurt.

17:54.034 --> 17:55.194
Okay!

17:59.804 --> 18:01.074
Do you know it?

18:04.614 --> 18:07.134
This place. Do you know it?

18:10.484 --> 18:11.744
Y-yes.

18:12.124 --> 18:15.754
I watched fireworks with my sister here.

18:15.754 --> 18:16.824
Yes.

18:16.824 --> 18:21.454
She was so small that she couldn't see them,
so I tried putting her on my shoulders.

18:22.294 --> 18:23.264
Yes.

18:23.634 --> 18:27.834
She's always running into people,
and she cries a lot.

18:29.104 --> 18:30.404
Yes...

18:46.184 --> 18:49.354
Why did you make that wish
on the wishing stones?

18:52.164 --> 18:55.654
Why did you want to become an adult?

19:01.374 --> 19:04.164
It's because... because I'm a burden.

19:05.004 --> 19:11.344
I'm just a burden to you, Hiro!
I always have been.

19:15.314 --> 19:19.044
But I'm not an adult at all!

19:20.984 --> 19:26.424
Even though I've gotten this big,
I'm nothing but a nuisance to you!

19:27.864 --> 19:29.024
I'm sorry.

19:31.504 --> 19:33.934
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

19:34.304 --> 19:35.794
I'm sorry!

19:54.524 --> 19:55.884
Karada.

20:22.054 --> 20:24.154
That was too much food.

20:24.154 --> 20:25.384
Miss Shoko.

20:42.634 --> 20:43.904
Is everything okay?

20:44.404 --> 20:45.564
Yes.

20:53.444 --> 20:54.844
Ah...

20:58.354 --> 21:00.214
All right, see you.

21:00.624 --> 21:01.914
Actually... Nogami.

21:05.064 --> 21:07.724
Here. Care to eat with us?

21:07.724 --> 21:08.294
TAKOYAKI
Here. Care to eat with us?

21:08.294 --> 21:10.124
TAKOYAKI

21:10.294 --> 21:14.094
Sorry. I hate takoyaki.

21:22.844 --> 21:24.474
Let's go together!

21:24.474 --> 21:27.384
Let's go home together, Miss Shoko!

21:29.314 --> 21:31.114
Just give it up, Nogami.

21:32.124 --> 21:35.954
Once she's spoken her mind,
my little sister doesn't change it.

21:41.894 --> 21:43.364
Fine.

21:44.234 --> 21:46.664
Fine, I get it. Let go.

21:46.664 --> 21:47.494
Okay!

21:50.204 --> 21:51.694
Let's go back together.

21:53.804 --> 21:54.904
Okay!

22:14.364 --> 22:20.604
Narenai kutsu wo haita

22:20.604 --> 22:25.334
Ippozutsu taeru itami

22:26.774 --> 22:33.044
Soredemo aruku no wa

22:33.044 --> 22:37.844
Kaeru basho ga aru kara

22:38.624 --> 22:46.764
Watashi ga watashi wo mitsumete

22:46.764 --> 22:51.354
Kizuita wasuremono

22:54.504 --> 23:00.674
Anato to issho ni itai

23:00.674 --> 23:07.384
Chikaku de, tooku de kanjitai yo

23:07.384 --> 23:13.254
Atarimae no mainichi

23:13.254 --> 23:19.894
Itoshii anato to tsukuritsuzukeru

23:19.894 --> 23:27.324
"Tadaima" to kutsu wo nuide, dakishimeru

23:27.564 --> 23:32.404
My sweet home

23:45.354 --> 23:48.814
A far-off summer day. The voices of children.

23:49.194 --> 23:52.994
The passage of time forgotten,
till the shadows of dusk lengthen.

23:53.924 --> 23:57.124
I've turned my back on it. On that other me...

23:58.204 --> 24:01.964
On that other path that offered no passage.

24:02.534 --> 24:05.634
Why, now, must I return there?

24:06.544 --> 24:07.744
